# BuildKit picks up "<dockerfile>.dockerignore" for this specific Dockerfile
# (buildx >= v0.33), so the repo-root build context stays lean.
#
# This image only COPYs package.json (the Omni version), apps/*-dsh (what each
# plugin packs), apps/automagik.json and apps/automagik.mjs (the pinned Automagik
# release and its fetcher) and deploy/admin-ui; everything else is left out.
*
!package.json
!apps/*-dsh
!apps/automagik.json
!apps/automagik.mjs
!deploy/admin-ui
**/node_modules
apps/*/dev
!apps/omni-channels-dsh/dev/harness/package.json
apps/*/test
deploy/admin-ui/build
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.log
.DS_Store
